31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. Now that the first night has passed, I wonder if any of us have gained a sense of clarity regarding our situation.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have some information. I am the Seer, and I divined George last night. He is human. This narrows our search slightly and gives us a reliable starting point.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"I appreciate your confirmation, Minako. Since you have identified me as human, I trust your word for now and will support your findings as we proceed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"That is a bold move to reveal yourself so early, Minako. While it provides us with a confirmed human, it also makes you a primary target for the werewolf tonight.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, Minako is the Seer! That's so cool! Does that mean George is definitely a good guy? I'm going to trust you both!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is indeed a courageous act, Minako. By placing yourself in danger, you have given us a beacon of truth. We must now ensure that your sacrifice of safety is not in vain.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I am aware of the risk, but providing a confirmed human early on stabilizes the group. Now, we must consider who among the remaining three is most likely to be the werewolf.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"Since Minako has cleared me, the focus shifts to Servas, Asuka, and Sakura. Servas, your words are always very comforting, but perhaps they are a bit too perfect for this situation?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas"",""Asuka"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I noticed that too. Servas has been consistently steering the conversation toward harmony and trust, which could be a strategic way to avoid scrutiny while we are still feeling each other out.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, is Servas-san being too nice? I thought it was just because he's a grandpa, but maybe he's trying to trick us! Are you the wolf, Servas-san?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Your curiosity is a gift, Sakura, but please do not let it lead you to unfair conclusions. I only wish for us to remain united, for a divided village is a feast for the wolf.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"While unity is a noble goal, Servas, your insistence on it is becoming a pattern. In a game of deception, those who most strongly advocate for trust are often the ones with the most to hide.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,"I must agree with Minako. Your responses are consistently deflective, Servas. You avoid answering the suspicion directly and instead pivot back to philosophical platitudes. It is starting to feel like a calculated mask.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I concur. Servas, you haven't provided a single piece of logical analysis or a specific observation about anyone else; you only offer generalities. This lack of substance is highly suspicious given the circumstances.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm starting to feel it too! Servas-san is being super-duper mysterious. It's like he's reading from a book instead of talking to us! Are you really a good guy, or are you a big bad wolf?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy thing to be misunderstood, but I accept your scrutiny with a peaceful heart. If my desire for harmony seems suspicious, then I shall simply ask you to trust your logic and the Seer's guidance.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Your logic is exactly what I am using, Servas. Your refusal to engage with the specific accusations and your reliance on emotional appeals only strengthen the case against you. I believe you are the werewolf.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,"I find myself agreeing with Minako. Your composure is admirable, but it has crossed the line into evasion. I believe it is time for us to act on these observations and vote.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I have no reason to doubt the Seer's logic. Servas has failed to provide any evidence of his innocence other than a plea for trust, which is a classic tactic of the werewolf. I vote for Servas.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I don't like it when people are mean, but the detective in me says Servas-san is acting really fishy! I'm sorry, Servas-san, but I'm voting for you too!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
